# utilities-terminal: a terminal window seen straight on. Two row titlebar lit
# from above, dark navy screen, grey shell prompt from the same ramp as the
# titlebar. The chevron is 2px thick so it survives 16px in the panel, the
# underscore sits on its lower tip. Grey rather than a phosphor green, which
# would collide with the Spotify icon.
